The code in app/ was derived from Ownfoil 2.5.0 in October 2026 and is
maintained separately since then; the UPSTREAM file records up to which Ownfoil
release improvements have been brought in. Modifications made by guslma,
starting in October 2026:

- New name, logo and visual theme.
- Interface in English, Portuguese and Spanish, with a language selector
  (app/gamedock_i18n.py, i18n/, locales/).
- Reorganized screens: Overview (former Stats and Tasks pages), Settings in
  tabs (with the former Services page), "Connect your console" (former Setup
  page) and a library toolbar with filter menus.
- List view of the library, editing of users (app/gamedock_users.py), an About
  dialog and a Logs tab in Settings (app/gamedock_system.py).
- Fixes: the console address shown inside Docker bridge networks, and the
  Settings page on a fresh install before the catalogue is downloaded.

The full history of these changes is in this repository's Git log.

Third-party components shipped in app/static/vendor/, under their own licenses
(MIT), with their notices kept in the files:
- Bootstrap 5.3.1 (https://getbootstrap.com)
- Bootstrap Icons 1.11.1 (https://icons.getbootstrap.com)
